THE EIGHTH DECK OF THE VARGHUR, WHICH
IS AT THE SAME TIME THE FIRST SECTION,
IS THE COMMAND AND NERVE CENTER OF THE
SHIP. ON THIS DECK THERE ARE IMPORTANT
CONTROL UNITS FOR SHIP MACHINERY AS 
WELL AS THE SHIP`S MAIN COMPUTER, THE
HY"GOR-COORDINATOR.

IN ADDITION, DECK 8 HAS A SPECIAL 
GARRYNN TRANSMITTER WHICH PERMITS A
CHANGE TO ALL DECKS. A MAINTENANCE 
SHAFT, LEADING DIRECTLY FROM DECK 8 TO
DECK 4, WAS BUILT FOR THE MAINTENANCE
ROBOTS.
